                  "name": "",
                  "type": {
                    "name": "error",
                    "kind": "basic"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "doc": {
            "list": [
              {
                "text": "WebSocketMiddleware upgrades the HTTP connection to WebSocket, then enters"
              },
              {
                "text": "a message loop. For each incoming message it injects the raw []byte into"
              },
              {
                "text": "the DI container and calls next (the handler method). The handler receives"
              },
              {
                "text": "the []byte as a parameter and returns []byte as a reply that is sent back"
              },
              {
                "text": "to the client."
              },
              {
                "text": ""
              },
              {
                "text": "The middleware also stores the *websocket.Conn on the context so the handler"
              },
              {
                "text": "can do advanced operations if needed (e.g. close, ping)."
              }
            ]
          }
        }
